# Implementation plan — Spec 1.9.3

## Summary

Reusable **`UserSelectionDialog`** in `@webonone/ui-kit` plus WebOnOne **`users_roles`** table replacing `super_admins` / `company_memberships`. See [02-ui-kit-user-selection-dialog.md](./02-ui-kit-user-selection-dialog.md), [05-webonone-users-roles.md](./05-webonone-users-roles.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.9.3` |
| Package builds | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |
| Super admin seed | Set `SUPER_ADMIN_USER_ID` (Identity `user_id`) in `webonone-v2/backend/.env` |

